## Implementation Notes

### MongoDB Schema (collection: `users`)
```json
{
  "username": "dr_manish",
  "email": "manish@aiims.edu",
  "password_hash": "<bcrypt>",
  "profile_type": "student | pg_resident | junior_doctor | fellow | educator",
  "college_name": "AIIMS Delhi",
  "professional_role": "pg_resident",
  "created_at": "ISODate"
}
```

### API Endpoints Added
| Method | Route | Purpose |
|--------|-------|---------|
| POST | `/api/auth/signup` | Register new user → returns JWT |
| POST | `/api/auth/signin` | Login (username or email) → returns JWT |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Get current user from Bearer token |

### JWT Storage
- Token stored in `localStorage` under key `denoisex_token`
- Navbar reads from localStorage on mount to show correct state

### Where to Put MongoDB Connection String
Edit `backend/.env`:
```
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@cluster0.xxxxx.mongodb.net/denoisex?retryWrites=true&w=majority
JWT_SECRET=any-long-random-string-here
JWT_EXPIRE_MINUTES=10080
```

